{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The skies burn as an alien fleet unleashes relentless warships, promising annihilation. Take control  in this pixelated 2D arcade-style space shoot-'em-up, and become the savior our home planet desperately needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience classic arcade action with a modern touch:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Orbital Siege</strong> blends elements of planetary defense with the arcade shooting of Asteroids.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intense Shoot-'em-up Gameplay:</strong> Face waves of unique alien enemies and boss battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade Your Ship:</strong> Collect power-ups to enhance your firepower, speed, and defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dodge and Weave:</strong> Skillfully maneuver through dense enemy fire using precise controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pixelated Retro Aesthetic:</strong> Enjoy vibrant pixel art that pays homage to the golden age of arcade gaming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556690/extras/738fc13398c2dd9de8f0841613891dda.poster.avif?t=1751544885\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556690/extras/738fc13398c2dd9de8f0841613891dda.webm?t=1751544885\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556690?t=1751544885","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556690?t=1751544885","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556690/790886393cbe11ee7272d7ec60c28501930d5b